{"id": "Ugwumw_M6dsR82deBPp4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 13, "text": "촉촉한 초록잎처럼\n마음 한편에도\n맑고 짙은 초록이\n오래도록 머무는 시간이 되기를 바랍니다 :)\n\nLike tender green leaves touched by rain, \nI hope this becomes a time\nwhen a clear and deep green\nremains in a corner of your heart\nfor a long while. 🌿", "published": "2026-07-16T23:38:40", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
